## Data shipped in the repository

* **Test fixtures** (`tests/`): short excerpts of the abuse.ch SSL Blacklist (CC0, https://sslbl.abuse.ch), FIRST
  EPSS scores (EPSS by FIRST, https://www.first.org/epss), CISA CSAF advisories (US Government work) and MITRE ATT&CK
  (see below). Everything else in the fixtures is synthetic.

