## Python dependencies

Installed from PyPI by `uv` (and included in the Docker image), not stored in this repository. All are under
permissive or file-level copyleft licences: MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, Apache-2.0, ISC, PSF-2.0, 0BSD, Zlib,
CC0-1.0, MPL-2.0 (certifi, tqdm) and MPL-1.1 (tld, chosen from its MPL-1.1 / GPL-2.0 / LGPL-2.1+ options). Direct
dependencies: certifi, cryptography, duckdb, fastapi, feedparser, httpx, maxminddb, numpy, python-multipart, pytz,
trafilatura, uvicorn, websockets; on macOS, mlx-lm. The full list with versions is in `uv.lock`.

## Docker image

Built on the official `python:3.14-slim` image (Python: PSF License; Debian packages under their own licences, sources
at https://sources.debian.org) with `uv` (MIT or Apache-2.0). The Compose file can also run Caddy (Apache-2.0) and
Qdrant (Apache-2.0).
